tory","text":"Inventory at the end of FY2025 was $983 million, about 64 days of cost of revenue. The most in the years shown was about 79 days, at the end of FY2022.","cites":["MSI.inventory.2025","MSI.cost.2025","MSI.inventory.2022","MSI.cost.2022"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest segment in FY2025 was Products and Systems Integration: $7.3 billion, 62% of revenue.","cites":["MSI.mix.segment.2025.0","MSI.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2025 was United States: $7.9 billion, 68% of revenue.","cites":["MSI.mix.geography.2025.0","MSI.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest product line or market in FY2025 was Mission Critical Networks (MCN): $8.6 billion, 74% of revenue.","cites":["MSI.mix.product.2025.0","MSI.revenue.2025"]}]}}